{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 17, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "性", "id": "性"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "歸", "id": "歸"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "求", "id": "求"}, {"form": "深", "id": "深"}, {"form": "火", "id": "火"}, {"form": "物", "id": "物"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.3637200390813515, "source": "禮", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.211017899468555, "source": "禮", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.0568672196412967, "source": "禮", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 1.9233358270167742, "source": "禮", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.0008145453919832, "source": "水", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 3.4431615807611875, "source": "水", "target": "火"}, {"weight": 1.8337236683270872, "source": "水", "target": "求"}, {"weight": 0.8041042511459289, "source": "水", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.8337236683270872, "source": "水", "target": "物"}, {"weight": 0.516422178694148, "source": "人", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.6514021115331325, "source": "人", "target": "深"}, {"weight": 1.3637200390813515, "source": "人", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 2.0568672196412967, "source": "人", "target": "歸"}, {"weight": 0.9582549309731873, "source": "人", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 0.11095707058598356, "source": "人", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 1.1405764877671418, "source": "仁", "target": "求"}, {"weight": 1.6514021115331325, "source": "仁", "target": "深"}, {"weight": 1.3637200390813515, "source": "仁", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.9027165398140387, "source": "仁